{"source":"McCollough 2023; exported text-content spans, 2026-09-15 (re-extracted)","page":4,"pageWidth":594,"pageHeight":783,"items":[{"text":"Photon-counting Detector versus Energy-integrating Detector CT for Luminal Stenosis","rect":[47.93749809265137,744.7187118530272,313.2656192779541,752.7187042236328],"fontSize":7.999992370605582},{"text":"4","rect":[47.93749809265137,21.39065551757806,52.749996185302734,29.390647888183498],"fontSize":7.999992370605437},{"text":"radiology.rsna.org","rect":[345.5468559265137,21.609366416931074,393.8593626022339,28.609359741210895],"fontSize":6.999993324279821},{"text":"■","rect":[397.1249771118164,23.625057220458867,399.2343521118164,27.125061035156172],"fontSize":3.5000038146973047},{"text":"Radiology:","rect":[402.7656555175781,21.609366416931074,432.3906469345093,28.609359741210895],"fontSize":6.999993324279821},{"text":"Volume 309: Number 3—December 2023","rect":[433.85936737060547,21.609366416931074,546.0312366485596,28.609359741210895],"fontSize":6.999993324279821},{"text":"In addition to the nonparametric test statistics, the Hodges-","rect":[59.92187976837158,722.2031049728394,288.73437881469727,732.2031097412108],"fontSize":10.000004768371468},{"text":"Lehmann estimator was used to estimate the median paired dif-","rect":[47.93749809265137,710.2188520431517,288.76562118530273,720.2188568115233],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"ferences along with their 95% CIs.","rect":[47.93749809265137,698.1718854904174,181.71874523162842,708.171890258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"P","rect":[184.01561737060547,698.1718854904174,189.57810401916504,708.171890258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"< 0.05 was considered to","rect":[192.39063262939453,698.1718854904174,288.14064502716064,708.171890258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"indicate a statistically significant difference. Statistical analyses","rect":[47.93749809265137,686.1874179840087,288.82813453674316,696.1874084472655],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"were performed by one author (R.E.C.) using R version 4.2.2","rect":[47.93749809265137,674.2187147140502,288.7031078338623,684.2187194824218],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"(R Foundation). For this pilot study, power calculations were","rect":[47.93749809265137,662.2344617843627,288.73437881469727,672.2344665527343],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"not performed.","rect":[47.93749809265137,650.1874952316283,105.45312881469727,660.1874999999999],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"Results","rect":[47.93749809265137,626.1093263626097,79.5468807220459,638.1093292236327],"fontSize":12.00000286102295},{"text":"Participant Characteristics","rect":[47.93749809265137,600.5469160079955,148.125,610.5469207763671],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"A total of 25 participants (median age, 59.5 years [IQR,","rect":[47.93749809265137,588.1875257492064,288.76562118530273,598.187530517578],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"45.7–63.9 years]; 16 male participants, nine female partici-","rect":[47.93749809265137,576.2030582427977,288.7968921661377,586.2030487060546],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"pants) were enrolled, with no excluded participants (Fig 1,","rect":[47.93749809265137,564.2343549728392,288.78127098083496,574.2343597412108],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"Table 1). For the EID CT scans, two of 25 (8%) participants","rect":[47.93749809265137,552.2501020431517,288.71872901916504,562.2501068115234],"fontSize":10.000004768371696},{"text":"were scanned in the dual-source adaptive prospectively trig-","rect":[47.93749809265137,540.2031354904174,288.76562118530273,550.203140258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"gered sequential scan mode, and 23 of 25 (92%) participants","rect":[47.93749809265137,528.2186679840088,288.78127098083496,538.2186584472655],"fontSize":9.999990463256722},{"text":"were scanned in the dual-source adaptive retrospectively gated","rect":[47.93749809265137,516.2499647140502,288.78127098083496,526.2499694824218],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"scan mode. Due to the large number of EID CT examinations","rect":[305.73437690734863,722.2031049728394,546.4999866485596,732.2031097412108],"fontSize":10.000004768371468},{"text":"performed in the retrospectively gated scan mode for clinical","rect":[305.73437690734863,710.2188520431517,546.6093921661377,720.2188568115233],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"indications (23 of 25 [92%] participants), the mean applied","rect":[305.73437690734863,698.1718854904174,546.5625,708.171890258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"radiation dose (volume CT dose index) was 25.7 mGy ± 15.0","rect":[305.73437690734863,686.1874179840087,546.4999866485596,696.1874084472655],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"[SD]. Due to the use of the prospectively triggered scan mode","rect":[305.73437690734863,674.2187147140502,546.4999866485596,684.2187194824218],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"at PCD CT, the mean volume CT dose index was lower, at","rect":[305.73437690734863,662.2344617843627,546.4218807220459,672.2344665527343],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"7.4 mGy ± 3.1.","rect":[305.73437690734863,650.1874952316283,365.51562309265137,660.1874999999999],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"Reader Estimation of Percent Stenosis","rect":[305.73437690734863,626.5469770431517,453.56250286102295,636.5469818115233],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"On EID CT scans, reader 1 marked a total of 39 stenoses, with","rect":[305.73437690734863,614.2500715255736,546.4843654632568,624.2500762939452],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"20 of these having a visual percent stenosis of at least 30%.","rect":[305.73437690734863,602.2031049728392,546.4999866485596,612.2031097412108],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"Reader 2 marked only 32 stenoses, of which only 14 had a","rect":[305.73437690734863,590.2188520431517,546.4375019073486,600.2188568115233],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"percent stenosis of at least 30%.","rect":[305.73437690734863,578.2499485015868,429.2187452316284,588.2499389648438],"fontSize":9.99999046325695},{"text":"Calcifications appeared smaller on 100-keV images from","rect":[317.7187442779541,566.1874179840087,546.5000009536743,576.1874084472655],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"PCD CT due to improved spatial resolution and decreased","rect":[305.73437690734863,554.2187147140503,546.5156078338623,564.2187194824218],"fontSize":10.000004768371468},{"text":"calcium blooming. Figures 2 and 3 demonstrate the visual","rect":[305.73437690734863,542.2344617843627,546.5468788146973,552.2344665527344],"fontSize":10.000004768371696},{"text":"differences in stenotic lesions between EID CT and PCD","rect":[305.73437690734863,530.2499799728392,546.4375019073486,540.2499847412109],"fontSize":10.000004768371696},{"text":"CT images.","rect":[305.73437690734863,518.2030277252197,352.37500190734863,528.2030181884764],"fontSize":9.999990463256722},{"text":"For both readers, median percent stenosis observed on","rect":[317.7187442779541,506.2187604904174,546.5000009536743,516.218765258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"PCD CT images was lower than that observed on EID CT","rect":[305.73437690734863,494.25007152557356,546.4687442779541,504.25007629394526],"fontSize":10.000004768371696},{"text":"images (reader 1: 20.6% [IQR, 8.8%–61.2%] vs 31.8%","rect":[305.73437690734863,482.2655897140501,546.5468788146973,492.2655944824218],"fontSize":10.000004768371696},{"text":"[IQR, 12.9%–69.7%], respectively,","rect":[305.73437690734863,470.2188520431518,444.48437690734863,480.2188568115234],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"P","rect":[447.0312309265137,470.2188520431518,452.59373188018793,480.2188568115234],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"< .001; reader 2: 6.5%","rect":[455.7499694824218,470.2188520431518,545.8749675750732,480.2188568115234],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"[IQR, 0.4%–54.1%] vs 22.9% [IQR, 1.8%–67.4%],","rect":[305.73437690734863,458.23437023162836,509.3437528610229,468.2343749999999],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"P","rect":[510.40626525878906,458.23437023162836,515.9687662124634,468.2343749999999],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"= .002)","rect":[517.8281021118164,458.23437023162836,545.5780935287476,468.2343749999999],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"(Table 2). The estimated median difference in percent stenosis","rect":[305.73437690734863,446.26568126678455,546.5468788146973,456.26568603515614],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"between EID CT and PCD CT was −5.3% (95% CI: −7.6%,","rect":[305.73437690734863,434.28121376037586,546.4531230926514,444.2812042236327],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"−3.5%) for reader 1 and −7.2% (95% CI: −11.5%, −2.2%) for","rect":[305.73437690734863,422.2344617843627,546.4999866485596,432.23446655273426],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"reader 2. As shown in Figure 4, only a few lesions showed an","rect":[305.73437690734863,410.24997997283924,546.4843654632568,420.2499847412109],"fontSize":10.000004768371639},{"text":"increase in percent stenosis at PCD CT.","rect":[305.73437690734863,398.2812910079955,459.4531202316284,408.2812957763671],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"For reader 1, the CAD-RADS scores at PCD and EID CT","rect":[317.7187442779541,386.2968235015868,546.3593816757202,396.2968139648437],"fontSize":9.999990463256893},{"text":"did not differ for any of the 25 participants (zero of 25 [0%]).","rect":[305.73437690734863,374.2500715255736,546.531229019165,384.2500762939452],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"For reader 2, the CAD-RADS scores at PCD CT and EID CT","rect":[305.73437690734863,362.26558971405024,546.4375019073486,372.26559448242176],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"did not differ for 18 of 25 (72%) participants and differed for","rect":[305.73437690734863,350.2813367843627,546.5156078338623,360.28134155273426],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"seven of 25 (28%) participants. From EID CT to PCD CT,","rect":[305.73437690734863,338.31243324279774,546.4218807220459,348.3124237060546],"fontSize":9.999990463256836},{"text":"CAD-RADS scores decreased by one level in five of the 25","rect":[305.73437690734863,326.2499027252196,546.4687442779541,336.2498931884765],"fontSize":9.999990463256893},{"text":"participants (20%), decreased by three levels in one participant","rect":[305.73437690734863,314.28121376037586,546.6093921661377,324.28120422363276],"fontSize":9.999990463256893},{"text":"(4%), and changed from a score of 1 to a score of N (nondiag-","rect":[305.73437690734863,302.2969465255736,546.4531230926514,312.29695129394514],"fontSize":10.000004768371525},{"text":"nostic) in one participant (4%) due to a motion artifact.","rect":[305.73437690734863,290.3280429840087,523.2656192779541,300.32803344726557],"fontSize":9.999990463256893},{"text":"Interreader Reliability","rect":[449.5781135559082,266.6094617843627,533.8593578338623,276.6094665527343],"fontSize":10.000004768371639},{"text":"The intraclass correlation","rect":[449.5781135559082,254.3125562667846,545.9374809265137,264.3125610351562],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"for the readers’ estima-","rect":[449.5781135559082,242.34365272521958,545.9374809265137,252.34364318847645],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"tion of percent stenosis","rect":[449.5781135559082,230.28133678436274,545.9374809265137,240.2813415527343],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"was moderate, with coef-","rect":[449.5781135559082,218.3124332427978,545.9062385559082,228.31242370605455],"fontSize":9.99999046325675},{"text":"ficients of 0.64 (95% CI:","rect":[449.5781135559082,206.32816600799552,545.8906173706055,216.3281707763671],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"0.40, 0.80) at EID CT","rect":[449.5781135559082,194.3594770431518,545.8593606948853,204.35948181152335],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"and 0.69 (95% CI: 0.45,","rect":[449.5781135559082,182.29694652557365,545.8906173706055,192.2969512939452],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"0.84) at PCD CT. Bland-","rect":[449.5781135559082,170.3280429840087,545.8437395095825,180.32803344726557],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"Altman analyses (Fig 5)","rect":[449.5781135559082,158.34377574920643,545.9218597412109,168.343780517578],"fontSize":10.000004768371582},{"text":"showed some systematic","rect":[449.5781135559082,146.3593082427978,545.9218597412109,156.35929870605455],"fontSize":9.99999046325675},{"text":"differences","rect":[449.5781135559082,134.31255626678455,489.62498188018793,144.3125610351561],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"between","rect":[495.92187881469727,134.31255626678455,527.1718740463257,144.3125610351561],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"the","rect":[533.4999847412109,134.31255626678455,545.5312299728394,144.3125610351561],"fontSize":10.000004768371554},{"text":"readers.","rect":[449.5781135559082,122.32808876037589,478.3124828338623,132.32807922363276],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"The","rect":[484.3593978881836,122.32808876037589,498.906283378601,132.32807922363276],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"mean","rect":[505.06250381469727,122.32808876037589,525.9531211853027,132.32807922363276],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"dif-","rect":[532.0156288146973,122.32808876037589,545.5312442779541,132.32807922363276],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"ference between readers","rect":[449.5781135559082,110.35938549041735,545.9218597412109,120.359390258789],"fontSize":10.000004768371653},{"text":"was −6.8% (95% limits","rect":[449.5781135559082,98.2968549728393,545.9062385559082,108.29685974121087],"fontSize":10.000004768371568},{"text":"of","rect":[449.5781135559082,86.32816600799555,457.2656106948853,96.32817077636712],"fontSize":10.000004768371568},{"text":"agreement:","rect":[465.48437118530273,86.32816600799555,507.0312452316284,96.32817077636712],"fontSize":10.000004768371568},{"text":"−60.3%","rect":[515.0312805175781,86.32816600799555,545.5781507492065,96.32817077636712],"fontSize":10.000004768371568},{"text":"to 46.7%) for EID CT","rect":[449.5781135559082,74.3436985015868,545.8593606948853,84.34368896484366],"fontSize":9.999990463256864},{"text":"and −10.3% (95% limits","rect":[449.5781135559082,62.37499523162836,545.9218597412109,72.37499999999993],"fontSize":10.000004768371568},{"text":"of agreement: −55.6% to","rect":[449.5781135559082,50.31246471405021,545.9062385559082,60.31246948242177],"fontSize":10.00000476837156},{"text":"Table 1: Participant Characteristics","rect":[54.4687557220459,485.7344369888304,191.42187595367432,494.2344360351562],"fontSize":8.499999046325797},{"text":"Variable","rect":[54.4687557220459,462.5311975479125,82.51562118530273,471.53118896484364],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Value","rect":[197.78125762939453,462.5311975479125,217.03126430511475,471.53118896484364],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Age (y)","rect":[54.4687557220459,448.5156040191649,79.53124523162842,457.51560974121077],"fontSize":9.000005722045842},{"text":"Median","rect":[63.43750476837158,437.0001010894775,90.1406192779541,446.0001068115233],"fontSize":9.000005722045842},{"text":"59.5 (45.7–63.9)","rect":[197.78125762939453,437.0001010894775,257.37502098083496,446.0001068115233],"fontSize":9.000005722045842},{"text":"Range","rect":[63.43750476837158,425.4999475479125,85.09374618530273,434.49993896484364],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"18–78","rect":[197.78125762939453,425.4999475479125,220.2031373977661,434.49993896484364],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Sex*","rect":[54.4687557220459,413.90616703033436,69.7031307220459,422.9061584472655],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"M","rect":[63.43750476837158,402.40622806549067,71.43749713897705,411.4062194824218],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"16 (64)","rect":[197.78125762939453,402.40622806549067,223.7187623977661,411.4062194824218],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"F","rect":[63.43750476837158,390.9062747955321,68.4375,399.906280517578],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"9 (36)","rect":[197.78125762939453,390.9062747955321,219.23439502716064,399.906280517578],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"Weight (kg)","rect":[54.4687557220459,379.3905572891234,95.90625286102295,388.3905487060546],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Median","rect":[63.43750476837158,367.81255531311024,90.1406192779541,376.81256103515614],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"83.6 (72.3–94.9)","rect":[197.78125762939453,367.81255531311024,257.37502098083496,376.81256103515614],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"Range","rect":[63.43750476837158,356.29683780670155,85.09374618530273,365.2968292236327],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"49.1–101","rect":[197.78125762939453,356.29683780670155,231.42189502716064,365.2968292236327],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Note.—Except where indicated, data in parentheses are IQRs.","rect":[54.4687557220459,340.79694557189936,269.17187690734863,349.79695129394526],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"Included participants (","rect":[54.4687557220459,330.78130531311024,133.20312023162842,339.78131103515614],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"n","rect":[133.39061737060547,330.78130531311024,137.89060592651367,339.78131103515614],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"= 25) underwent energy-integrating","rect":[140.15625,330.78130531311024,263.90625,339.78131103515614],"fontSize":9.000005722045898},{"text":"detector CT and photon-counting detector CT.","rect":[54.4687557220459,320.7656650543212,219.42187786102295,329.76567077636713],"fontSize":9.000005722045955},{"text":"* Data are numbers of participants, with percentages in","rect":[54.4687557220459,308.78119754791254,245.32812595367432,317.7811889648437],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"parentheses.","rect":[54.4687557220459,298.7655572891235,96.29686832427979,307.76554870605463],"fontSize":8.999991416931152},{"text":"Figure 2:","rect":[47.93749809265137,100.73436069488511,82.46874332427979,109.23435974121081],"fontSize":8.499999046325698},{"text":"Axial images from an energy-integrating detector (EID) CT system (left) and a photon-counting detector (PCD) CT","rect":[90.48437118530273,100.8436660766601,432.92186737060547,108.84365844726554],"fontSize":7.99999237060544},{"text":"system at 100 keV (right) in a 63-year-old male participant referred for clinical coronary CT angiography. In the left main artery (inset","rect":[47.93749809265137,90.82802581787095,433.00000190734863,98.82801818847649],"fontSize":7.99999237060554},{"text":"enlarged images), the calcium is less bright and the lumen appears larger on the 100-keV PCD CT image, whereas the visible lumen","rect":[47.93749809265137,80.8906488418578,433.15627098083496,88.89065551757803],"fontSize":8.000006675720229},{"text":"on the EID CT image is relatively small due to calcium blooming (inset images). The visual percent diameter luminal stenosis estimate","rect":[47.93749809265137,70.87500858306875,433.1406211853027,78.87501525878898],"fontSize":8.000006675720229},{"text":"was 95% based on the EID CT image and 60% based on the PCD CT image. Window width was 500 HU and window level was","rect":[47.93749809265137,60.84380435943597,433.24999809265137,68.8438110351562],"fontSize":8.000006675720222},{"text":"1500 HU for EID and PCD CT.","rect":[47.93749809265137,50.906227111816314,139.85937595367432,58.906219482421754],"fontSize":7.99999237060544}]}
